{"id":61578,"mal_id":61578,"title":"Seitokai ni mo Ana wa Aru!","englishTitle":"Even the Student Council Has Its Holes!","title_english":"Even the Student Council Has Its Holes!","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["There Is Also a Hole in the Student Organization!"],"en":"Even the Student Council Has Its Holes!","ja":"生徒会にも穴はある！"},"synopsis":"Ume Mizunoe, a first-year student at the prestigious Fujinari Academy, excels in Japanese literature but struggles so badly in science that his chances of advancing are at risk. Hoping to boost his academic record, he joins the student council—only to find himself surrounded by a cast of quirky characters: a charismatic yet secretly shy president, a kind but intimidating treasurer, an adorably cheeky boy, and a tiny, stray-cat-like secretary.\n\nThrown into a whirlwind of chaotic daily life, Ume's school days are about to get a lot more unpredictable—and a lot more lively!\n\n(Source: MAL News)","synopsis_es":"Ume Mizunoe, un estudiante de primer año en la prestigiosa Academia Fujinari, sobresale en literatura japonesa pero tiene tantas dificultades en ciencias que sus posibilidades de avanzar están en riesgo. Con la esperanza de mejorar su expediente académico, se une al consejo estudiantil, solo para encontrarse rodeado de un elenco de personajes extravagantes: un presidente carismático pero secretamente tímido, un tesorero amable pero intimidante, un niño adorablemente descarado y una secretaria diminuta con forma de gato callejero.\n\nArrojada a un torbellino de caótica vida diaria, los días escolares de Ume están a punto de volverse mucho más impredecibles... ¡y mucho más animados!\n\n(Fuente: Noticias MAL)","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"currently_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1420,"average_episode_duration":1420,"startDate":"2026-10-04","start_date":"2026-10-04","endDate":null,"end_date":null,"season":"fall","year":2026,"start_season":{"year":2026,"season":"fall"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score"